    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Cold air and lying down definitely sets it off. I get some relief from honey and warm water. Severe, I'd say. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know.",
